Package: dyadfast
Title: Fast Dyadic-Robust Variance Estimation (Aronow, Samii & Assenova 2015)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xiang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "x@example.com")
Description: Vectorised O(nK) implementation of the Aronow, Samii & Assenova (2015)
    cluster-robust variance estimator for dyadic data. Eliminates the O(m * n * K) loop
    of existing implementations via a single scatter-add Hajek projection.
    Algebraically equivalent to the dyadRobust loop formula for undirected networks.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: sandwich
